<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: SOCCER-CZECH REPUBLIC AND SPAIN DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CZECH REPUBLIC AND SPAIN DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech Republic and Spain drew </p>
<p>0-0 in a World Cup European group six qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 19,223</p>
<p>Group six standings (tabulate under - played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Yugoslavia	   3   3   0   0  17   2    9</p>
<p> Slovakia	     2   2   0   0   8   1    6</p>
<p> Czech Republic     2   1   1   0   6   0    4</p>
<p> Spain		  2   1   1   0   6   2    4</p>
<p> Faroe Islands	4   0   0   4   5  19    0</p>
<p> Malta		  3   0   0   3   0  18    0</p>
<p>Next matches: Nov  10 Yugoslavia v Czech Republic, Nov 13</p>
<p>Spain v Slovakia</p>
</text>
